# Cave rats (11-05, CIPlay ironreef_caverns_rats; in a test world): one rat at the hall end of the Reef Workings'
# tunnel B and one at the hall's east end - alive, on the dug floor, under the rock (not on the hill over the tunnel), walking; pictures of both
# pairs. Points as in its recipe.
# (11-07: the player waits outside mouth A, 20 m and more from both rats: in the hall, 9-11 m from them, a rat ran out
